meta {
  name: Create a project
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/general/projects
  body: multipartForm
  auth: inherit
}

body:multipart-form {
  title: Example Project Title
  description: An optional project description
  file: @file(/path/to/image.jpg)
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Create a Project
  
  Creates a new project record. Optionally uploads a project image to Cloudinary under `/Cedarrise Initiative/DASHBOARD-ASSETS/PROJECTS`. Invalidates the projects cache on success.
  
  ## Authorization
  
  - **Authentication:** Required — Bearer token via `authenticate()`.
  - **Permission:** `read` — enforced by `authorize("read")`.
  
  ## Request
  
  **Content-Type:** `multipart/form-data`
  
  ### Body Fields
  
  | Field         | Type   | Required | Validation                                            |
  |---------------|--------|----------|-------------------------------------------------------|
  | `title`       | string | ✅       | Min 3 characters, max 150 characters.                 |
  | `description` | string | ❌       | Optional text description.                            |
  | `file`        | file   | ❌       | Image file (jpeg, jpg, png, webp). Max 20 MB.         |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the newly created project record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "title": "Example Project Title",
      "description": "An optional project description",
      "imageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/...",
      "imagePublicId": "public_id_string",
      "status": "ongoing",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-01T00:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-01T00:00:00.000Z"
    },
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Cache Invalidation
  
  - **Deleted Key:** `cedarrise:dashboard:projects`
  - The projects list cache is cleared after a successful creation.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                     |
  |-----------------------------|-------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Validation failed (title too short, invalid file type, etc.). |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid Bearer token.                |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | Insufficient permissions.                       |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error or Cloudinary upload failure. |
}
